                                                "sense_id": "11bed2bb-876d-36b6-a794-d0710121369a",
                                                "text": "As a result, many Black people remained unfairly enslaved and indentured in the so-called free territory. This was not legal slavery (also known as de jure slavery), but slavery in practice (de facto slavery)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
